Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:53.82,screen,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn@FZKai-Z03\bord0.6\fax-0.25\fs30\3c&H6F7274&\c&H6F7274&\frz289.1\pos(598.4,270.4)}就算是戰鬥人偶\N也始終是女孩子
